  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>S</mi></math>, be the set of all real roots of the equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "contains exactly two elements.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "is a singleton.",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "is an empty set.",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "contains at least four elements.",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><math><mi>t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0107_34d0b6301e63.png\" /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has a solution at&nbsp;<math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>a</mi></math>.<br />So, it is a&nbsp;singleton set.</p>"
  }
